        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Russo, Daddy X, The Dirtball, Johnny Richter, Jared, John E. Necro, Jon Spencer\n- Bands: Unwritten Law, Jon Spencer Blues Explosion, Hed PE\n- Albums: American Underdog\n- Places: Poway, California, New York City\n- Events: Warped Tour\n\nFacts:\n- Unwritten Law is an American rock band that formed in 1990 in Poway, California.\n- Jon Spencer Blues Explosion is an American alternative rock trio that formed in 1991 and is based in New York City, New York.\n- Unwritten Law has released seven full-length studio albums and has toured internationally, including performances on the Warped Tour.\n- American Underdog includes collaborations with Daddy X, The Dirtball, Johnny Richter, Scott Russo of Unwritten Law, Jared of Hed PE, and John E. Necro.",
